<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπάζω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκόπασα</span> (v. infr.): pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκόπακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			:—<i>grow weary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jo.</u>
					14.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θυμοῦ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Es.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>; of an abnormal pulsation, <i>abate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>; esp. of natural phenomena, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκόπασε</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
			ἄνεμος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.191
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				14.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἡ λίμνη κοπάσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					935a18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκόπασε τὸ πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					11.2
				</span></i>
			; of heat, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				1.8
			</span></i>.</div>
